her","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/8PQlNu9PJSCHUnkCokIrmcuWacC.jpg"},{"id":9931,"name":"Elisabeth Trissenaar","role":"Betti Klenze"},{"id":3757,"name":"Gottfried John","role":"Willi Klenze","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/duXWjkperrnUq094bgsYddJeIG0.jpg"},{"id":1865,"name":"Hark Bohm","role":"Senkenberg","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/qbK0MB6h73iuqXJ4e8ttaKdHB1C.jpg"},{"id":9932,"name":"Günter Lamprecht","role":"Hans Wetzel","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/r66A4bvkqoaqb4evgOk14LIpKXp.jpg"},{"id":2740,"name":"Lilo Pempeit","role":"Frau Ehmke","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/cKTUKW1TLHqi86hgNMRwiii8eLQ.jpg"},{"id":3769,"name":"Michael Ballhaus","role":"Counsel","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/9DHIGsrgeTWA0rch3fFGXTOl1lO.jpg"},{"id":2725,"name":"Rainer Werner Fassbinder","role":"Peddler","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/uZFSBv6Q4ZSwZr8wfLobBCiiC14.jpg"},{"id":32863,"name":"Günther Kaufmann","role":"American on Train","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/jx9S9EJHYIOWGDnZ3IzjvsQbzlz.jpg"},{"id":38140,"name":"Claus Holm","role":"Doctor","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/u6r0CVbH5KsZO8OzeuIua4yXFEW.jpg"},{"id":2733240,"name":"Anton Schiersner","role":"Grandpa Berger"},{"id":49263,"name":"Sonja Neudorfer","role":"Red Cross Nurse"},{"id":32422,"name":"Volker Spengler","role":"Train Conductor","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/8Sp51c1dL4XrLp4klyakr0UzD6E.jpg"},{"id":37345,"name":"Isolde Barth","role":"Vevi","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/nYUvJewwKevpDp7ho3kRMSTUZip.jpg"},{"id":51014,"name":"Bruce Low","role":"American at Conference","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/tq6yLRcq2hkKX2yWsM5Z044RDf6.jpg"},{"id":3755,"name":"Karl-Heinz von Hassel","role":"Prosecuting Counsel","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/bL06O3ReJrJD4xeAtUvVe4Yw3RJ.jpg"},{"id":1405859,"name":"Kristine De Loup","role":"Notary"},{"id":1285081,"name":"Hannes Kaetner","role":"Justice of the Peace"},{"id":9943,"name":"Barbara Baum","role":"(as Baum)"},{"id":18405,"name":"Peter Berling","role":"Bronski (as Berling)","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/oAlkmJ99mC8KfARMiaSDm4kn9nj.jpg"},{"id":49256,"name":"Rolf Bührmann","role":"Warden","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/lJWf1bJd0gImmNDxlfcPgx42Rtl.jpg"},{"id":1398348,"name":"Martin Häussler","role":"Reporter"},{"id":2733242,"name":"Horst-Dieter Klock","role":"Gentleman with Car"},{"id":9944,"name":"Georg Kuhn"},{"id":9939,"name":"Norbert Scherer","role":"Warden"},{"id":9942,"name":"Andreas Willim"},{"id":2733244,"name":"Arthur Glogau","role":"Warden (uncredited)"}],"crew":[],"videos":[],"watchProviders":[],"episodeGroups":[],"translations":[{"language":"it-IT","title":"Il matrimonio di Maria Braun","overview":"Maria si sposa nel 1943 e il marito parte subito per il fronte, dove viene dato per disperso. Per sopravvivere nella Germania sconfitta, Maria inizia una relazione con un americano, che viene ucciso in circostanze poco chiare al ritorno del marito. Questi si fa arrestare per salvare Maria, che seduce l'industriale Oswald diventando ricca e potente. Secondo un accordo tra i due uomini, alla morte di Oswald la donna tornerà con il marito...."},{"language":"en-US","title":"The Marriage of Maria Braun","overview":"Maria marries a young soldier in the last days of World War II, only for him to go missing in the war. She must rely on her beauty and ambition to navigate the difficult post-war years alone."},{"language":"de-DE","overview":"Deutschland im Jahr 1943: Während eines Luftangriffs in einer deutschen Stadt heiratet Maria den Soldaten Hermann Braun; das Standesamt wird durch die Explosion einer Fliegerbombe zerstört. Hermann muss sofort wieder an die Front, und Maria ist auf sich allein gestellt. Nach Kriegsende nimmt sie ihr Schicksal in die eigene Hand. Die Nachricht, Hermann sei gefallen, veranlasst die mit ihrer Mutter und ihrem Großvater lebende Maria, als Bardame für den Lebensunterhalt der Familie zu sorgen. Sie beginnt eine Beziehung mit Bill, einem afroamerikanischen GI, der sich um sie kümmert und sie mit begehrten Gütern wie Nylonstrümpfen und Zigaretten versorgt. Marias Mann ist jedoch noch am Leben und kehrt aus der Kriegsgefangenschaft zurück.","tagline":"… sie währte nur einen halben Tag – und eine ganze Nacht."}],"images":{"logos":[],"posters":[],"backdrops":[]},"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/5W0TNe0e1FL1NpurzXms887dZb5.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/ejp6CZQ64mEvewfit2fSIpOYxGR.jpg","seasons":[],"schema":{}}},"artworkLibrary":{"tmdb":{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","id":661,"type":"movie","originalLanguage":"de-DE","series":{"poster":{"it":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/5W0TNe0e1FL1NpurzXms887dZb5.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/5W0TNe0e1FL1NpurzXms887dZb5.jpg","language":"it","width":666,"height":1000},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/5W0TNe0e1FL1NpurzXms887dZb5.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/5W0TNe0e1FL1NpurzXms887dZb5.jpg","language":"it","width":666,"height":1000},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/vVOtEm3JMNyVy68dkEcpk1xUaZW.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/vVOtEm3JMNyVy68dkEcpk1xUaZW.jpg","language":"it","width":1999,"height":3000},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/L1BLQxtBN5ybLwZx9F3a8Ykv5M.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/L1BLQxtBN5ybLwZx9F3a8Ykv5M.jpg","language":"it","width":2000,"height":3000}]},"en":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/tXjZEzlf4WQwZ4Dt53gXeJVuO7p.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/tXjZEzlf4WQwZ4Dt53gXeJVuO7p.jpg","language":"en","width":1000,"height":1500},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"http